    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6701f9a4ac30e1489708f1a0c0381925.poster.avif?t=1603471014\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6701f9a4ac30e1489708f1a0c0381925.webm?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6701f9a4ac30e1489708f1a0c0381925.mp4?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Kabounce\u2122 - multiplayer pinball sport, you are the ball! <br><br>Take complete control of the ball and reach ridiculous speeds with intuitive momentum and rhythm based movement in this re-imagining of pinball. Rack up sweet combos and points by hitting bumper pins and perform spinning skill moves in short, 5 minute, matches. Eliminate opposing players to steal their hard-earned points and score to win! Up to 8 players online, 4 vs 4.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SINGLEPLAYER</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/74643b7eb747df9280232ec0d357bfd4.poster.avif?t=1603471014\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/74643b7eb747df9280232ec0d357bfd4.webm?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Take the action offline with over 50 time-attack parkour challenges (and be sure to snag up the hidden skins and rewards). Keep up the pace, cut corners, use walls and bumpers - earn a bronze, silver, gold or developer star! Top the leaderboards for the coveted blue star.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ROLL IN STYLE</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/d2377e18715f59570862f75168aa115a.poster.avif?t=1603471014\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/d2377e18715f59570862f75168aa115a.webm?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Millions of ridiculous, over the top cosmetic combinations - we proudly offer you the most elaborate pinball garage in the world! Select a pinball, paint it, match some stylish eyewear and accessories - top it off with hats, horns or hair*.<br><br><i>*Afro included.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SCORE</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6ab25cfc662d6922e52b47bd1d1a605b.poster.avif?t=1603471014\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6ab25cfc662d6922e52b47bd1d1a605b.webm?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6ab25cfc662d6922e52b47bd1d1a605b.mp4?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You too can ride this rollercoaster track, it's not just for show, here you bank your dough - oOOoh hey, we did a rhyme.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><i>[insert really long list of features here to make your game look more impressive]</i><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Up to 8-player online, 4 versus 4. <br></li><li><strong>Split Screen:</strong> Play up to 4-player split screen locally - or join an online match.<br></li><li><strong>Time Attack:</strong> Test your skill and race against ghosts or friends in parkour-like platforming challenges - or improve your global rank on the leaderboards.<br></li><li><strong>Roll in style:</strong> Millions of possible combinations to personalize your pinball!<br></li><li><strong>Cross-platform:</strong> Cross play support between PlayStation\u00ae4 and Steam players.<br></li><li><strong>Ranked:</strong> The same thing as Casual Quick Play really, sure - you get an icon plus rating for boasting, but why?<br></li><li><strong>Bots:</strong> Each with their own personality and playing style, watch out for M.A.X. he is very [explicit]. If S.A.M. is on your team, we're sorry for your loss.<br></li><li><strong>Matchmaking:</strong> You may not love the person we set you up with, but we'll match you anyway.<br></li><li><strong>Abilities:</strong> select between powerful abilities to capture bumpers and eliminate players.<br></li><li><strong>Original Sound Track:</strong> A dozen Original Electronic Sound Tracks and multiple in-match dynamic sound tracks that change based on how you play (if it doesn't, that means you're doing it wrong :)).</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6701f9a4ac30e1489708f1a0c0381925.poster.avif?t=1603471014\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6701f9a4ac30e1489708f1a0c0381925.webm?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6701f9a4ac30e1489708f1a0c0381925.mp4?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Kabounce\u2122 - multiplayer pinball sport, you are the ball! <br><br>Take complete control of the ball and reach ridiculous speeds with intuitive momentum and rhythm based movement in this re-imagining of pinball. Rack up sweet combos and points by hitting bumper pins and perform spinning skill moves in short, 5 minute, matches. Eliminate opposing players to steal their hard-earned points and score to win! Up to 8 players online, 4 vs 4.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SINGLEPLAYER</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/74643b7eb747df9280232ec0d357bfd4.poster.avif?t=1603471014\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/74643b7eb747df9280232ec0d357bfd4.webm?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Take the action offline with over 50 time-attack parkour challenges (and be sure to snag up the hidden skins and rewards). Keep up the pace, cut corners, use walls and bumpers - earn a bronze, silver, gold or developer star! Top the leaderboards for the coveted blue star.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ROLL IN STYLE</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/d2377e18715f59570862f75168aa115a.poster.avif?t=1603471014\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/d2377e18715f59570862f75168aa115a.webm?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Millions of ridiculous, over the top cosmetic combinations - we proudly offer you the most elaborate pinball garage in the world! Select a pinball, paint it, match some stylish eyewear and accessories - top it off with hats, horns or hair*.<br><br><i>*Afro included.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SCORE</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6ab25cfc662d6922e52b47bd1d1a605b.poster.avif?t=1603471014\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6ab25cfc662d6922e52b47bd1d1a605b.webm?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/431930/extras/6ab25cfc662d6922e52b47bd1d1a605b.mp4?t=1603471014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You too can ride this rollercoaster track, it's not just for show, here you bank your dough - oOOoh hey, we did a rhyme.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><i>[insert really long list of features here to make your game look more impressive]</i><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Up to 8-player online, 4 versus 4. <br></li><li><strong>Split Screen:</strong> Play up to 4-player split screen locally - or join an online match.<br></li><li><strong>Time Attack:</strong> Test your skill and race against ghosts or friends in parkour-like platforming challenges - or improve your global rank on the leaderboards.<br></li><li><strong>Roll in style:</strong> Millions of possible combinations to personalize your pinball!<br></li><li><strong>Cross-platform:</strong> Cross play support between PlayStation\u00ae4 and Steam players.<br></li><li><strong>Ranked:</strong> The same thing as Casual Quick Play really, sure - you get an icon plus rating for boasting, but why?<br></li><li><strong>Bots:</strong> Each with their own personality and playing style, watch out for M.A.X. he is very [explicit]. If S.A.M. is on your team, we're sorry for your loss.<br></li><li><strong>Matchmaking:</strong> You may not love the person we set you up with, but we'll match you anyway.<br></li><li><strong>Abilities:</strong> select between powerful abilities to capture bumpers and eliminate players.<br></li><li><strong>Original Sound Track:</strong> A dozen Original Electronic Sound Tracks and multiple in-match dynamic sound tracks that change based on how you play (if it doesn't, that means you're doing it wrong :)).</li></ul>",
